{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100388","id":2234847283,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6FNRAz","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100388","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100388.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100388.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100388","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100388/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100388/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100388/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/830f25010f062cc1aea1a3e48746aab29addf561","number":100388,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix canvas background mode not clearing correctly in Compatibility renderer","user":{"login":"Namey5","id":38927424,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4OTI3NDI0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38927424?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Namey5","html_url":"https://github.com/Namey5","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Namey5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Namey5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Namey5/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Namey5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Namey5/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Namey5/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Namey5/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Namey5/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Namey5/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"There was an inconsistency in framebuffer clear behaviour between Compatibility and the other renderers when using the 'Canvas' background mode.\r\n\r\nMore specifically, when using an intermediate framebuffer in the GLES3 backend (eg. when `Glow` post-processing effect was enabled), the framebuffer was not being cleared before having the current `rt` copied over, resulting in a feedback loop equivalent to setting `Environment::background` to `RS::ENV_BG_KEEP`.\r\n\r\nIn the other backends this doesn't appear to be the case, so I have modified the GLES3 backend to clear the framebuffer before copying when `Environment::background` is set to `RS::ENV_BG_CANVAS`.\r\n\r\n| Background Mode | Compatibility | Compatibility (w/ Glow) | Forward+ |\r\n|--------|--------|--------|--------|\r\n| Clear Color | ![compat_color](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4e5f9c7c-5d3e-4031-b0b3-0bf46024dfd5) | ![compat_glow_color](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/17f200b9-148b-4d58-a571-7202a2405f34) | ![forward_color](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/49f6323c-47c7-411f-b3ab-82ed2cc01414) |\r\n| Sky | ![compat_sky](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1f9e4e84-2172-4f6b-8868-b683f39ade74) | ![compat_glow_sky](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5818dade-0d47-49a3-9cf7-4f9327ba6a63) | ![forward_sky](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7690de5a-2894-4eb7-a6ca-e963db7615ad) |\r\n| Canvas | ![compat_canvas](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/16a1da07-be6a-464d-ab22-6cbf945adbae) | ![compat_glow_canvas](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b6cc7a59-0214-45fc-b76f-b093f0c563bc) | ![forward_canvas](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c9f40b7d-0b52-4723-9439-6b90ae72097a) |\r\n| Keep | ![compat_keep](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f607fbec-3830-4033-b822-20d1a417c30b) | ![compat_glow_keep](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5f0a443d-cb3e-41c4-9712-b7f078de94b0) | ![forward_keep](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9307cf29-115a-49c8-b70d-46d5a3233d80) |\r\n| Camera Feed | ![compat_feed](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dd17ab24-fcdf-4fb4-878e-6213650c6d50) | ![compat_glow_feed](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f34f1a61-efc4-4948-8e0c-e84ccc37984f) | ![forward_feed](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/39670017-67a1-4364-90b5-7d2fb26474d9) |\r\n\r\n[Looks like the other backends have had issues with this in the past too](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/68805), but would certainly like some extra testing on this as I am not too familiar with this setup.\r\n\r\nFixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100203","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":7008779076,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABocF7RA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/cherrypick:4.3","name":"cherrypick:4.3","description":"Considered for cherry-picking into a future 4.3.x release","color":"446699","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":10558797,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AoR1N","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/20","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/20","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/20/labels","number":20,"state":"closed","title":"4.4","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg